                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump & Governor Abbott are attempting rig an election before the first ballot has been cast by forcing a mid-decade redistricting. \n\nThis is an attempt by Trump and Abbott to launch back into Jim Crow by silencing the voices of millions of Texans. \n\nThey gutted your Medicaid. They took food away from your kids\u2019 mouths. They can\u2019t win fair and square, so they are going to cheat. This isn\u2019t about any one district. This is about the future of our country.\n\nToday, I stood with Democrats from Texas and across the country to defend your voting rights. \n\nhttps://t.co/mUhZCbDMGf",
